f;font-weight: normal;\">商鞅变法</strong>。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><span data-flag=\"tag\" style=\"background:#FC5832;font-size:16px;color:#fff;padding:5px;margin:10px 0px;display:inline-block\">2</span><span> <b>商鞅变法：</b></span></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" lang=\"en\" data-flag=\"normal\">商鞅本是魏国人，但为了实现自己心中的报复而投奔秦国，倾注了自己毕生的心血先后推行了两次大规模的变法改革运动：</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"1\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M05/FC/75/wKgJX1ohaOqizw7sAAElv0YtPXc807.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M05/FC/75/wKgJX1ohaOqizw7sAAElv0YtPXc807.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M05/FC/75/wKgJX1ohaOqizw7sAAElv0YtPXc807.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"882\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M05/FC/75/wKgJX1ohaOqizw7sAAElv0YtPXc807.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"164\" /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">商鞅（约公元前395年－公元前338年）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">（一）首次变法：</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">1、把李悝的《法经》在秦国公布实施，增加连坐法，主张轻罪重刑，称为“以刑去刑”。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">2、废除旧的世卿世禄制度，实行依军功授田宅的新法。（尚首功）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">3、实行奖励垦荒，重农抑商、奖励耕织政策</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">4、焚烧儒家经典，禁止私门请托、游说求官</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">（二）二次变法：</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">1、废除井田制，正式承认土地私有和买卖的合法性，打破贵族靠分封垄断的土地的局面，此项举措促使中国早期的地主阶级诞生。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">2、设立“县”级的行政单位，“县”级官员直接由秦王选出，这就是之后秦朝郡县制的雏形。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">3、向东迁都，建都咸阳</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">4、按户按人口收缴军赋</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">推行变法的各国因此在诸侯纷争之中国力变得愈发雄厚，在战国末期，形成了七个大诸侯国并立的局面，他们便是我们熟知的“<strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">战国七雄</strong>”——齐楚燕韩赵魏秦</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"2\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M04/0A/E4/wKgJXlohabWSB6NLAAB-4OF608s100.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M04/0A/E4/wKgJXlohabWSB6NLAAB-4OF608s100.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M04/0A/E4/wKgJXlohabWSB6NLAAB-4OF608s100.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"438\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M04/0A/E4/wKgJXlohabWSB6NLAAB-4OF608s100.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"81\" /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">战国七雄</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><span data-flag=\"tag\" style=\"background:#FC5832;font-size:16px;color:#fff;padding:5px;margin:10px 0px;display:inline-block\">2</span><span> <b>诸子百家：</b></span></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">西周时期的分封制，促使诞生一种特殊的贵族阶层——士，这类贵族既没有爵位，也没有封地，他们为了求生，只能游走各国兜售自己的才学，由此促使诞生了春秋战国时期的<strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">诸子百家</strong>。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">1、老子：颠倒的世界与扭曲的哲学</strong></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"3\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M03/0A/F4/wKgJXlohanDDl76rAABMx2duSak722.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M03/0A/F4/wKgJXlohanDDl76rAABMx2duSak722.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M03/0A/F4/wKgJXlohanDDl76rAABMx2duSak722.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"1125\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group30/M03/0A/F4/wKgJXlohanDDl76rAABMx2duSak722.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"210\" /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">老子（<span>公元前571年，逝世于公元前471年</span>）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">老子的出关意义重大，它标志着当时的中国已经放弃了哲学，而是将更多的注意力放在对于名利的追逐之上。在老子的认知中，世间的关系都是颠倒并可以相互转化的，比如有与无、刚强与柔弱等等，体现了他朴素的辩证法思想。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">2、</strong><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">孔子：黑暗王国的残烛</strong></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-key=\"4\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group33/M08/5F/2E/wKgJTFoha1KSLTBrAAVvUN_E01E215.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group33/M08/5F/2E/wKgJTFoha1KSLTBrAAVvUN_E01E215.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group33/M08/5F/2E/wKgJTFoha1KSLTBrAAVvUN_E01E215.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"1000\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group33/M08/5F/2E/wKgJTFoha1KSLTBrAAVvUN_E01E215.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"186\" /><br /></strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">孔子（公元前551年―公元前479年）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">孔子是悬挂在那个遥远古世纪的一盏明灯。他周游列国，因材施教，有教无类，晚年更是编纂完成儒学的“五经”，其塑造的儒家学说更是成为了之后中国人的精神脊梁。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">3、墨子：向帝国挑战的剑侠</strong></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"5\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M01/16/50/wKgJnFohbDPiZ1z7AAH8o4B3kiI310.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M01/16/50/wKgJnFohbDPiZ1z7AAH8o4B3kiI310.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M01/16/50/wKgJnFohbDPiZ1z7AAH8o4B3kiI310.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"1102\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M01/16/50/wKgJnFohbDPiZ1z7AAH8o4B3kiI310.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"205\" /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">墨子（生卒年不详）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">墨子服役者皆可赴汤蹈火，死不旋踵。墨家学派简直就是一支敢死队。墨子的队伍重视防守，他反对战争的方式是以各种眼花缭乱的防守方式来阻止战争。中国的机械与技术都因此得到了发张。墨子生前坚持“兼爱”、“非攻”、“尚贤”的思想，可以说他是朴素的社会主义思想者。</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">4、</strong><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">孟子：王者师与大丈夫</strong></p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"6\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M02/FC/C9/wKgJX1ohbSmwjv1JAAChcCTD2FY453.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M02/FC/C9/wKgJX1ohbSmwjv1JAAChcCTD2FY453.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M02/FC/C9/wKgJX1ohbSmwjv1JAAChcCTD2FY453.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"799\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M02/FC/C9/wKgJX1ohbSmwjv1JAAChcCTD2FY453.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"149\" /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">孟子（前372年去世时间前289年）</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">孟子之所以是儒家的亚圣，因为他主要做了这三件事：把“仁”发展到了“义”；把“仁政”发展为更为具体的“王道”；强调“性善论”。除此外，孟子更难能可贵的一点是他可以以平等的身份去对待各位诸侯王，这种气度在之后的文人身上很少看到。</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">5、庄子：</strong><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">人在江湖与永恒的乡愁</strong></p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;text-align:justify\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"7\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group34/M02/33/81/wKgJYFohbgehgEADAABKUdUohko073.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group34/M02/33/81/wKgJYFohbgehgEADAABKUdUohko073.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group34/M02/33/81/wKgJYFohbgehgEADAABKUdUohko073.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"805\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group34/M02/33/81/wKgJYFohbgehgEADAABKUdUohko073.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"150\" /></p><p data-flag=\"backup\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" lang=\"en\">庄子（约公元前369年-公元前286年）</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\">在先秦诸子之中，庄子应该是最有魅力的，他能够把激情与超脱完美地结合起来，为我们齐贵贱生死，用丰富的想象去慰藉人心。古代学子进京赶考时都会带着四书五经，但是枕头下面，一定还藏着一本《庄子》。</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">6、荀子：养在深闺人未识</strong></p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\"><img data-key=\"8\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M03/CC/E3/wKgJnVohb1GQL3R9AAA3uKVu17g221.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M03/CC/E3/wKgJnVohb1GQL3R9AAA3uKVu17g221.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M03/CC/E3/wKgJnVohb1GQL3R9AAA3uKVu17g221.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"878\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group35/M03/CC/E3/wKgJnVohb1GQL3R9AAA3uKVu17g221.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"164\" /></p><p data-flag=\"backup\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" lang=\"en\">荀子（<span>公元前313年-公元前238年</span>）</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\">荀子是把儒家嫁出去的人，嫁给了帝王，但是嫁的不太好，是个妾。他提倡性恶论，希望儒生能放下自己独立的人格，从剥夺经济独立开始，逐渐剥夺人的思想和行为自由。</p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\">7、韩非：折断的双刃剑</strong></p><span><br /></span><p data-flag=\"normal\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" lang=\"en\"><strong style=\"color:#FC5832;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-key=\"9\" src=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M01/96/F1/wKgJSVohcB_QVlPjAAINpZ8KYZk438.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M01/96/F1/wKgJSVohcB_QVlPjAAINpZ8KYZk438.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M01/96/F1/wKgJSVohcB_QVlPjAAINpZ8KYZk438.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"421\" data-preview=\"http://image.xmcdn.com/group31/M01/96/F1/wKgJSVohcB_QVlPjAAINpZ8KYZk438.jpg?op_type=4&device_type=ios&upload_type=attachment&name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"78\" /></strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999999;line-height:24px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all\" data-flag=\"backup\" lang=\"en\">韩非（<span>约公元前280年—公元前233年</span>）</p><span><br /></span><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#333333;line-height:30px;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" data-flag=\"normal\" lang=\"en\">韩非强调“法”的威严性，主张“施不足以化，则除之”。他一生说“利”，但自己却死于“义”。为避免秦国吞并韩国，他主动出师秦国，却因一篇《说难》沦为阶下囚。在他临死前，更是用毕生才学写就两篇著名的散文——《解老》和《<span>喻老</span>》，我们所熟知的“塞翁失马”、“亡羊补牢”等成语典故都出自这两篇散文。</p><span><br /><br /></span>",
